/// the widget side.
///
/// Defaults to true.␀À␀c@À␀bì_À␀c@C/// What text to display in the text input control's action button.␀À␀c­À␀cPhÀ␀c­D/// What kind of action to request for the action button on the IME.␀À␀dÒÀ␀c½'À␀dÒ€ë/// Specifies how platforms may automatically capitalize text entered by the
